    "body": "Looking at the call sites for WritableStreamDefaultControllerClearAlgorithms and I can't really see any rhyme or reason behind them. I'd expect them to happen whenever we set [[state]] to \"errored\" (maybe \"erroring\"?) and \"closed\".\r\n\r\nPatching the immediate problem by moving that particular case later might be reasonable, but I wonder if we should do a more comprehensive reform of when they are cleared.",
